  "severity": "Important",
  "description": "The curl packages provide the libcurl library and the curl utility for downloading files from servers using various protocols, including HTTP, FTP, and LDAP.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\n* curl: libcurl: Unauthorized connection reuse due to a logical error (CVE-2026-8458)\n\n* curl: Information disclosure due to uncleared proxy authentication state (CVE-2026-8927)\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.",
